        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.33.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 33:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebyo byona nkabita aha mutima, naabyetegyereza, abahikiriire n'abanyabwengye n'ebi bakora oku biri omu mikono ya Ruhanga; yaaba biruga ahari rukundo, nari ahari rwango, tihaine orikukimanya. Byona biri aho omu maisho gaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.2.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mub 2:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.9.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 9:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.5.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 5:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Byona bihika ahari boona omu muringo gumwe, ahari ohikiriire n'ahari otahikiriire, aha murungi n'aha mubi, ahari oshemeire n'ahari otashemeire, aha mutambi w'ebitambo n'aha muntu otabitamba. Oku omurungi aba, nikwo n'omusiisi aba; arahira ni nk'otarahira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwo n'obubi obuba omuri byona ebikorwa ahansi y'eizooba, abantu boona kuhikwaho omuheru gumwe; ekindi, emitima y'abantu eijwire ebibi, kandi n'omu mitima yaabo habamu eiraro bakiriho; bwanyima y'ebyo bakurata abaafiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka okwatanisa n'abahuriire boona aba aine amatsiko, ahabw'okuba embwa ehuriire ekira entare efiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mub 1:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.14.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 14:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.31.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 31:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.88.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "88:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.26.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 26:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abahuriire bamanya ku barifa; kwonka abafiire tibagira ki bamanya, kandi baba batakiine bindi bihembo; ahabw'ouba tibaakiijukwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okukunda kwabo n'okwangana kwabo n'eihari ryabo, byona biba byahweireho; kandi baba batakiine mugabo gwona omuri byona ebirikukorwa ahansi y'eizooba okuhitsya ebiro byona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
