            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka omuri orwo rurembo hakaba harimu omworo oine obwengye; bwanyima ahabw'obwengye bwe yaarukiza. N'obu kiraabe kyabaire kityo, tihaine muntu weena owaijukire ogwo mworo. ",
          "type": "text",
